---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for AI Career Guide.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 16, 2026</p>
    <p>AI Career Guide is a static content website. This policy explains the data practices planned for the site.</p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2><ul><li>The current newsletter and contact forms do not submit data to a backend.</li><li>If analytics, a newsletter provider, or a form provider is connected later, the relevant data collection will be documented here.</li><li>Your theme preference may be stored locally in your browser using localStorage.</li></ul>
    <h2>External services</h2><p>The site links to third-party services and resources. Those services have their own privacy policies and data practices.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2><p>This policy may be updated when new services are added. The effective date will be changed accordingly.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> for privacy questions.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
